:: Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour
<<location 'seadocks'>><<effects>><<deadwood-harbour-context>>
<<if $nextPassage or $nextPassageCheck>>
  <span id='next'><<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] $passage>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<if $stress gte $stressmax>><<passoutbeach>><<exit>><</if>>
<<set $underwater to 0>>
<<if _harbour.event and _harbourNight>>
  <<include 'Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour Encounter'>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You are at Coldmoon Harbour, beyond the warehouses on Mer Street. An old breakwater shelters the water. Barnacles crust the foot of a rusted ladder, and strips of seaweed cling to the lower steps.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你在寒月港湾，梅尔街的货仓就在身后。旧防波堤挡住了外面的浪。生锈的梯子下端结满藤壶，低处的石阶上挂着几缕海草。
<</language>><br><br>
<<if _harbourNight>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The blood moon stains the water red. Fog spills over the breakwater, carrying the smell of salt and rot. A ship rests against the old quay. Torn black sails hang from its masts, and barnacles and weed cover the hull.
      <br><br>
      Pale figures stand along the rail. Others have already come ashore. They prise open crates and drag sacks towards the gangway. A crash comes from the warehouses. One of the doors has given way.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      血月将海面染成暗红。雾气漫过防波堤，带来海水与腐木的气味。一艘船停在旧码头旁，桅杆上挂着破烂的黑帆，船身结满藤壶和海草。
      <br><br>
      几道苍白的身影站在船舷边，另一些已经上了岸。他们撬开木箱，将货袋拖向跳板。货仓那边传来一声巨响，一扇门被撞开了。
  <</language>><br><br>
<<elseif Weather.precipitation is 'rain'>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Rain ticks against the warehouse roofs. Beyond them, loose rigging taps a steady rhythm against a mast.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      雨点敲打货仓屋顶。更远处，松脱的索具一下下碰着桅杆。
  <</language>><br><br>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      A gull lands on a mooring post. Water laps between the rocks below the quay, washing rounded glass and broken crockery into the gaps. The air smells of salt and drying seaweed.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      一只海鸥落在系船桩上。浪水拍进码头下的礁石，把磨圆的玻璃和碎瓷片推入石缝。空气里有海水的咸味，混着晾干的海草气味。
  <</language>><br><br>
<</if>>
<<deadwood-undead-moon>>
<<if !_harbourNight and _harbour.zephyr.stage is 4>>
  <<switch Math.floor(Time.days) % 3>>
    <<case 0>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Two sailors roll a barrel towards the warehouses. One recognises you and knocks a fist against the lid in greeting, nearly losing his grip. His companion swears and catches the rim before it reaches the steps.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          两个水手往货仓那边滚着酒桶。其中一个认出了你，敲敲桶盖当作招呼，险些松了手。另一个骂了一声，赶在桶滚下石阶前抓住了桶沿。
      <</language>>
    <<case 1>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          A sailor sits beside the mooring post, sewing a torn cuff. You recognise one of Zephyr's crew. He glances at the water when you pass. "Captain got the cargo back, then. Wouldn't stop complaining about it."
        <<option 'CN'>>
          一个水手坐在系船桩旁缝破掉的袖口。你认出那是泽菲尔的船员。你经过时，他朝水面看了一眼。“船长拿回货了吧。之前念叨个没完。”
      <</language>>
    <<default>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          A warehouse worker argues with a sailor over an empty bottle. "Deposit," she insists, holding out her hand. The sailor looks at you for support. You keep walking.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          货仓工人正为了一只空瓶同水手争执。“押金。”她伸着手。水手朝你投来求助的目光，你继续往前走。
      <</language>>
  <</switch>><br><br>
<</if>>
<<deadwood-harbour-result>>
  <<investigateicon>><<lanLink ['Explore the old quay (0:10)', '探索旧码头 (0:10)'] 'Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour'>>
    <<pass 10>><<deadwood-harbour-search>>
  <</lanLink>><br>
<<if $leftleg isnot 'bound' and $rightleg isnot 'bound' and !pcAreArmsBound('any')>>
  <<swimicon>><<lanLink ['Swim beside the breakwater (0:10)', '沿防波堤游泳 (0:10)'] 'Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour'>>
    <<pass 10>><<water>><<swimmingskilluse>><<tiredness 5>><<deadwood-harbour-search>>
    <<if !$MoreTransformations.harbour.event and !['relic', 'dawn'].includes($MoreTransformations.harbour.scene)>><<set $MoreTransformations.harbour.scene to 'swim'>><</if>>
  <</lanLink>><<gtiredness>><br>
  <<swimicon 'down'>><<lanLink ['Dive below the steps', '潜入石阶下的水中'] 'Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour Underwater'>>
    <<oxygenrefresh>><<wateraction>><<set $MoreTransformations.harbour.scene to '', $MoreTransformations.harbour.event to ''>>
  <</lanLink>><<loxygen>><br>
<</if>>
<br><<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to Mer Street (0:05)', '返回梅尔街 (0:05)'] 'Mer Street'>>
  <<set $MoreTransformations.harbour.event to '', $MoreTransformations.harbour.scene to ''>><<pass 5>>
<</lanLink>><br>

:: Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour Underwater
<<set $outside to 0, $location to 'sea'>><<underwater>><<effects>><<deadwood-harbour-context>>
<<if $nextPassage or $nextPassageCheck>>
  <span id='next'><<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] $passage>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<if $stress gte $stressmax>><<passoutbeach>><<exit>><</if>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    The water is green beneath the steps. Mussels cluster along a mooring chain, and small fish scatter as you approach. Below them, a broken boat lies half-buried in silt. Weed sways through its ribs.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    石阶下的海水泛着绿。系船链上挤着一簇贻贝，几条小鱼在你靠近时散开。下面横着一条半埋在淤泥里的破船，水草从船肋之间轻轻摆动。
<</language>><br><br>
<<deadwood-harbour-result>>
<<if _harbourNight and _harbour.event>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      "...Down here... help with the chest..." The words reach you clearly through the water. A swollen arm reaches from beneath the wreck, fingers hooked around a wooden chest. No bubbles rise from it. Overhead, footsteps thump across the pier.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      “……在底下……搭把手，把箱子抬上去……”人声清清楚楚地穿过海水。沉船底下伸出一只浮肿的手臂，手指扣着木箱，却不见一个气泡冒出来。头顶传来脚步踩过栈桥的震动。
  <</language>><br><br>
<<elseif $oxygen gt 0 and !pcAreArmsBound('any')>>
  <<icon 'coldmoon-harbour/wreckage.png'>><<lanLink ['Search among the wreckage', '在残骸之间搜寻'] 'Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour Underwater'>>
    <<wateraction>><<deadwood-harbour-search 'dive'>>
  <</lanLink>><<loxygen>><br>
<</if>>
<<if _harbourNight and _harbour.voice and _harbour.zephyr.stage is 2 and $oxygen gt 0 and !pcAreArmsBound('any') and maplebirch.get('Psyche')?.active>>
  <<swimicon 'down'>><<lanLink ['Follow the voice beneath the wreck', '循着呼唤游进残骸下面'] 'Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour Underwater'>>
    <<if maplebirch.get('Psyche')?.active and $MoreTransformations.harbour.zephyr.stage is 2 and $MoreTransformations.harbour.voice and Time.isBloodMoon()
      and $oxygen gt 0 and !pcAreArmsBound('any') and !$combat and !$possessed and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck>>
      <<wateraction>><<deadwood-harbour-context>>
      <<if _harbourNight and _harbour.zephyr.stage is 2 and $oxygen gt 0 and !pcAreArmsBound('any') and !$combat and !$possessed and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck>>
        <<set _harbour.zephyr.stage to 3, _harbour.scene to 'cargo_voice', _harbour.event to ''>>
        <<run maplebirch.get('Psyche')?.change(-150, 200)>><<tiredness 3>>
      <</if>>
    <</if>>
  <</lanLink>><<lllsanity>><<ggfear>><<loxygen>><<gtiredness>><br>
<</if>>
<<swimicon 'up'>><<lanLink ['Surface at the steps', '浮回石阶边'] 'Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour'>>
  <<wateraction>><<set $underwater to 0, $nooxygen to 0>>
  <<deadwood-harbour-context>>
<</lanLink>><<loxygen>><br>
